      "label": "Shared quasi‑weekly temperature cycle affecting both pendulum length and resonator elastic constants",
      "probability": 0.20,
      "rationale": "A ~5‑day temperature fluctuation could lengthen the pendulum (reducing its beat rate) and soften the resonator material, producing a delayed correlation. The same trend could also account for the modest downward drift in pendulum_obs after the baseline period.",
      "evidenceFor": [],
