      "rationale": "A temperature fluctuation with a ~5‑day period could simultaneously alter pendulum length (changing beat rate) and resonator elastic constants (changing cycles/beat) with different thermal inertia, producing the observed lagged correlation and the modest downward drift in pendulum_obs after day 10.",
