  "reason": "Incorporate day‑29 ledger data: pendulum_obs shows modest downward drift (z = -2.11) and resonator_obs readings match forecast within tolerance, confirming stability of resonator. Cross‑instrument analysis continues to show a strong 3‑day lagged correlation (0.949) between pendulum_lab and resonator_obs, unchanged from prior days. Given the persistence and specificity of this correlation, I raise the probability of the data‑processing pipeline interdependency hypothesis to 0.45 and lower the temperature, timestamp, observer‑schedule, and microseismic hypotheses proportionally. Residual probability is adjusted to 0.14."
}

